                  Interactive Frontends
                </h5>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Astro (Island Architecture)</span>
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Next.js / React</span>
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Anime.js & Motion CSS</span>
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">HTML5 Canvas / SVGs</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ORGANISMS: Core Competencies -->
      <section
        id="competencies"
        class="py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#1f1f1f] border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800"
      >
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <div class="text-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
            <h2
              class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-wood-accent uppercase"
            >
              Skills & Strategy
            </h2>
            <h3
              class="mt-2 text-3xl leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl"
            >
              Core Competencies
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
              High-level professional skills developed through diverse life
              experiences and technical leadership.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
            <!-- Collaboration & Leadership -->
            <div
              class="flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-grey-light dark:hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-all duration-300 group"
              data-aos="fade-up"
            >
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-wood-accent/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-wood-accent transition-colors duration-300"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-6 h-6 text-wood-accent group-hover:text-white"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="currentColor"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5s-3 1.34-3 3 1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z"
                  />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4
                  class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2"
                >
                  Collaboration & Leadership
                </h4>
                <p
                  class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed"
                >
                  Proven experience leading development teams and managing
                  school-wide portals during OJT. Skilled in sprint planning and
                  clear communication.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Problem Solving -->
            <div
              class="flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-grey-light dark:hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-all duration-300 group"
              data-aos="fade-up"
              data-aos-delay="100"
            >
              <div
                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-wood-accent/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-wood-accent transition-colors duration-300"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-6 h-6 text-wood-accent group-hover:text-white"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="currentColor"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1.44 14.8c-.2.2-.45.3-.78.3-.33 0-.59-.1-.78-.3-.19-.19-.29-.46-.29-.81 0-.35.1-.62.29-.81.2-.2.45-.3.78-.3.33 0 .59.1.78.3.19.2.29.47.29.81s-.1.62-.29.81zM14.24 11c-.34.42-.87.89-1.57 1.4-.29.21-.52.41-.69.6-.17.18-.3.36-.39.52-.09.16-.16.32-.2.48-.04.16-.08.3-.11.41h-1.31c.03-.27.09-.57.17-.9s.2-.66.36-1c.16-.34.39-.67.68-.99.29-.32.65-.67 1.07-1.04.41-.37.74-.71.99-1.02.25-.31.37-.64.37-1.01 0-.35-.13-.65-.4-.9-.27-.25-.63-.38-1.07-.38-.45 0-.82.13-1.1.38-.28.25-.43.55-.44.89h-1.32c.02-.7.27-1.27.76-1.71.49-.44 1.14-.66 1.97-.66.86 0 1.54.23 2.05.69.51.46.77 1.07.77 1.83 0 .5-.11.95-.33 1.34z"
